]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Revisão: estruturas enfáticas","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Função","Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["foco","It is X that…","**It is plain words that carry disagreement.**"],["intensidade","so… that / such… that","**So subtle is the signal that outsiders miss it.**"],["proibição enfática","Never should…","**Never should silence be read as consent.**"],["condição única","Only by… can…","**Only by asking can you be sure.**"]],"cap":"Revisão: estruturas enfáticas"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**It is worth noting that…** introduz um dado importante de forma neutra e acadêmica."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"It is plain words ___ carry disagreement. (that)","a":"that","why":"cleft."},{"s":"So subtle is the signal ___ outsiders miss it. (that)","a":"that","why":"so … that."},{"s":"Never ___ silence be read as consent. (should)","a":"should","why":"inversão."},{"s":"Only by asking ___ you be sure. (can)","a":"can","why":"inversão."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["cross-cultural signal","sinal intercultural"],["direct disagreement","discordância direta"],["indirect refusal","recusa indireta"],["polite silence","silêncio educado"],["communication style","estilo de comunicação"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["consent","Is","silence"],"ans":"Is silence consent","pt":"Silêncio é consentimento?"},{"words":["do","some","cultures","signal","disagreement","How"],"ans":"How do some cultures signal disagreement","pt":"Como algumas culturas sinalizam discordância?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"cross-cultural signal","pos":"word","pt":"sinal intercultural","ex":"Cross-cultural signal.","expt":"Sinal intercultural."},{"w":"direct disagreement","pos":"word","pt":"discordância direta","ex":"Direc